{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17162","headline":"奉和圣制丰年多庆九日示怀 · 权德舆","name":"奉和圣制丰年多庆九日示怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒露应秋杪，清光澄曙空。\n泽均行苇厚，年庆华黍丰。\n声明畅八表，宴喜陶九功。\n文丽日月合，乐和天地同。\n圣言在推诚，臣职惟匪躬。\n琐细何以报，翾飞淳化中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}